    {
      "id": "ko-plain-a2-001",
      "level": "A2",
      "sourceSha256": "b1df03dd9da285b96bca38db7bc2b61d8291faf954348ff4b5133211ffae5d20",
      "lines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "수업이 끝난 뒤에 몇 명이 근처 카페에 갔어요.",
          "meaning": "After class, a few of us went to a café nearby.",
          "speechSeconds": 4.9485,
          "audio": "https://audio.talktag.co.kr/Korean/audio-essays-articles/segments-001/v1-20261016/a2/line-01.mp3?v=9873444b98a7",
          "sha256": "9873444b98a755694e83478ae0c107750f6611a22124ca9feb06efd26b96de24",
          "bytes": 52245
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "우리는 오늘 배운 표현을 다시 말해 봤어요.",
          "meaning": "We tried saying the expressions we had learned that day again.",
          "speechSeconds": 4.876,
          "audio": "https://audio.talktag.co.kr/Korean/audio-essays-articles/segments-001/v1-20261016/a2/line-02.mp3?v=66a14d5a0f5d",
          "sha256": "66a14d5a0f5df4f3fc0417952543c19d7ba551a156cac50094ad3ab0dcd2034a",
          "bytes": 52029
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "한 친구가 다음 주에 같이 연습하자고 했어요.",
          "meaning": "One classmate suggested that we practise together next week.",
          "speechSeconds": 5.341,
          "audio": "https://audio.talktag.co.kr/Korean/audio-essays-articles/segments-001/v1-20261016/a2/line-03.mp3?v=a6fd77609ad0",
          "sha256": "a6fd77609ad08cfa478286f0b5ece1f219a8e25fea6c6f25728afedbcb9cb5db",
          "bytes": 56469
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "text": "저는 좋은 생각이라고 말했어요.",
          "meaning": "I said that it sounded like a good idea.",
          "speechSeconds": 3.8555,
          "audio": "https://audio.talktag.co.kr/Korean/audio-essays-articles/segments-001/v1-20261016/a2/line-04.mp3?v=278c4d5306f7",
          "sha256": "278c4d5306f7be5ef5d4d5af8ec7519877bb4adceac8d04d17f9bb9675a84870",
          "bytes": 40653
        },
        {
          "index": 5,
          "text": "혼자 공부할 때보다 더 재미있을 것 같아요.",
          "meaning": "I think it will be more enjoyable than studying alone.",
          "speechSeconds": 4.45,
          "audio": "https://audio.talktag.co.kr/Korean/audio-essays-articles/segments-001/v1-20261016/a2/line-05.mp3?v=6b3f2acd02c9",
          "sha256": "6b3f2acd02c9c28ac8d2e78d0792713ed72a38274ae449c6efc32680493cc697",
          "bytes": 48357
        }
      ],
