    {
      "id": "ko-plain-b1-001",
      "level": "B1",
      "sourceSha256": "9101400e97cdf3d30b4434be2c01c029787672f76a408dea2623e9226e1f4f48",
      "lines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "언어를 배울 때는 틀리지 않는 것보다 말을 계속해 보는 경험이 중요할 때가 있어요.",
          "meaning": "When learning a language, the experience of keeping a conversation going can sometimes matter more than not making mistakes.",
          "speechSeconds": 8.517,
          "audio": "https://audio.talktag.co.kr/Korean/audio-essays-articles/segments-001/v1-20261016/b1/line-01.mp3?v=203e30fe6a9b",
          "sha256": "203e30fe6a9b7f2bc96614b693d0c0d8449751b6c5a4143ae1f822280cefbee3",
          "bytes": 87789
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "지역 모임에서는 교과서에서 배운 표현을 실제 사람에게 써 볼 수 있어요.",
          "meaning": "At a local group, you can use expressions from a textbook with real people.",
          "speechSeconds": 7.5325,
          "audio": "https://audio.talktag.co.kr/Korean/audio-essays-articles/segments-001/v1-20261016/b1/line-02.mp3?v=56b483800896",
          "sha256": "56b48380089626e80b84e62cc3dfe8268cdfb354576d1dc3eb088206e6815cd7",
          "bytes": 77637
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "물론 빠른 대화는 부담스러울 수 있어요.",
          "meaning": "Of course, fast conversation can feel overwhelming.",
          "speechSeconds": 4.15,
          "audio": "https://audio.talktag.co.kr/Korean/audio-essays-articles/segments-001/v1-20261016/b1/line-03.mp3?v=1658863bf213",
          "sha256": "1658863bf213323bf3dfd62ef546ca9d56075094c28cb1088cd671b4fa23b0f8",
          "bytes": 42885
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "text": "그래서 좋은 모임은 질문할 시간을 주고, 이해하지 못한 부분을 다시 물어볼 수 있게 해요.",
          "meaning": "That is why a good group makes room for questions and lets people ask again about what they did not understand.",
          "speechSeconds": 12.83,
          "audio": "https://audio.talktag.co.kr/Korean/audio-essays-articles/segments-001/v1-20261016/b1/line-04.mp3?v=9d636f8dcee9",
          "sha256": "9d636f8dcee90b541f3a25ce610e496583ce89ff4b6bf321beb38f125269309a",
          "bytes": 124965
        },
        {
          "index": 5,
          "text": "작은 대화가 쌓이면 자신감도 조금씩 커져요.",
          "meaning": "As small conversations accumulate, confidence grows little by little.",
          "speechSeconds": 7.15,
          "audio": "https://audio.talktag.co.kr/Korean/audio-essays-articles/segments-001/v1-20261016/b1/line-05.mp3?v=3e8bf0b8f3c2",
          "sha256": "3e8bf0b8f3c2fb893f4e43b4918651ba21512e6e74fa4a76f0b5fa66ab5be6ae",
          "bytes": 72549
        }
      ],
