    {
      "id": "ko-plain-b2-001",
      "level": "B2",
      "sourceSha256": "06769e3edc641f154beef2c5dcc3c446d25bef1e3d906895c0691c3990b21e63",
      "lines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "새로운 사람이 모임에 들어왔을 때, 친절하게 인사하는 것만으로는 충분하지 않을 수 있어요.",
          "meaning": "When someone new joins a group, a friendly greeting alone may not be enough.",
          "speechSeconds": 8.782,
          "audio": "https://audio.talktag.co.kr/Korean/audio-essays-articles/segments-001/v1-20261016/b2/line-01.mp3?v=24b676815a6d",
          "sha256": "24b676815a6d5752b17cbf1a2c55a02c0dae1d3a0ad4cb8c3d3aa3be93ed020e",
          "bytes": 95445
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "활동의 규칙이 복잡하거나 설명이 길면 참여자는 시작하기도 전에 자신감을 잃을 수 있기 때문이에요.",
          "meaning": "If the rules are complicated or the explanation is long, participants can lose confidence before they even begin.",
          "speechSeconds": 10.338,
          "audio": "https://audio.talktag.co.kr/Korean/audio-essays-articles/segments-001/v1-20261016/b2/line-02.mp3?v=b90dc43e39b1",
          "sha256": "b90dc43e39b1383748a18181f2f74b08a4dc023533b6ec9054b231b479327078",
          "bytes": 108165
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "반대로 짧은 예시와 짝 활동이 있으면 누구나 첫 문장을 말하기 쉬워져요.",
          "meaning": "By contrast, a short example and paired activity make it easier for anyone to say a first sentence.",
          "speechSeconds": 8.1785,
          "audio": "https://audio.talktag.co.kr/Korean/audio-essays-articles/segments-001/v1-20261016/b2/line-03.mp3?v=e673a2029934",
          "sha256": "e673a2029934fba6d043e484cca366bef964de0f1e88a17eb3933ee4b42bbed1",
          "bytes": 82653
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "text": "진행자는 가장 많이 말하는 사람만 보지 말고, 아직 말하지 않은 사람에게도 선택권을 주어야 해요.",
          "meaning": "A facilitator should not focus only on the people who speak the most; they should also give choice to people who have not spoken yet.",
          "speechSeconds": 9.96,
          "audio": "https://audio.talktag.co.kr/Korean/audio-essays-articles/segments-001/v1-20261016/b2/line-04.mp3?v=3a4e224cffab",
          "sha256": "3a4e224cffabc2900f4fc4e18ca5c0ff32a632c33c19c96e43d5f7755ca3b745",
          "bytes": 104373
        },
        {
          "index": 5,
          "text": "참여는 개인의 용기만으로 생기는 것이 아니라, 함께 설계하는 환경에서 자라요.",
          "meaning": "Participation does not arise from individual courage alone; it grows in an environment people design together.",
          "speechSeconds": 10.93,
          "audio": "https://audio.talktag.co.kr/Korean/audio-essays-articles/segments-001/v1-20261016/b2/line-05.mp3?v=bc52d5a08fb5",
          "sha256": "bc52d5a08fb55de79df01acf3cc9592a7db6b7a213c677c8522a90303b2ee600",
          "bytes": 109053
        }
      ],
